        "ha" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ƙididdiga na iya sauyawa. Wannan ciniki ya saita mafi ƙarancin abin karɓa; ana lissafin sauyin farashi bisa tayin yanzu."
