        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On %@, the native coin can be sent to this address. Issued tokens generally need an active account and a trustline to the correct issuer, sometimes with issuer approval. Oath does not create trustlines yet."
